1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:08,521
This video shows a meditation screen in a wellness app. The figure breathes while the session runs, and holds still when you pause.

2
00:00:09,067 --> 00:00:17,556
Our session screen has a title, a breathing hint, and the time left. Let's keep in state whether the session is paused.

3
00:00:23,933 --> 00:00:25,814
Paused starts as false.

4
00:00:27,033 --> 00:00:30,769
Now the figure, playing only while the session is not paused.

5
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:48,106
Play, set to not paused, plays it right now. The file repeats, so the figure keeps breathing.

6
00:00:49,333 --> 00:00:52,781
Let's add the buttons that pause and resume the session.

7
00:01:06,033 --> 00:01:12,668
One button shows at a time. Pause session while it runs, and Resume session while it is paused.

8
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:15,964
Let's pause, and then resume.

9
00:01:21,167 --> 00:01:25,869
It holds still on pause, and carries on from the same moment on resume.

10
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:34,989
So, one property follows your state. The figure breathes while the session runs, and waits while the session waits.
